                                "sense_id": "37e19a86-0a59-3097-8092-b73a12bdfa92",
                                "text": "Forsothe he that is vnpacient, schal suffre harm; and whanne he hath rauyshid, he schal leie to anothir thing.",
                                "translation": "Forsooth he that is unpatient, shall suffer harm; and when he hath ravished, he shall lay to another thing.",
                                "english": "Forsooth he that is unpatient, shall suffer harm; and when he hath ravished, he shall lay to another thing."
