                                "sense_id": "37e19a86-0a59-3097-8092-b73a12bdfa92",
                                "text": "Gond. That I hate truely, thou hadst better bin a devill.\nOrian. Why my unpatient Lord?\nGond. Devils were once good, there they excell'd you wom[e]n."
                            },
